{
  "id": "undo-on-two-devices",
  "title": "The same review is undone on two devices",
  "covers": [
    "ticket follow-up 6: earliest undo wins",
    "replay: an undone review leaves the replay set"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "A's second review of C is undone on A at T+20 and, independently, on B at T+15.",
    "A's undo reaches the server first and is recorded. B's undo has a SMALLER hlc, so it replaces it (undone_hlc is lowered, never raised or cleared).",
    "Had they arrived in the other order, A's undo would have been a no-op. Either way: undone_hlc = B's clock, on every replica.",
    "Only the first transition (not undone -> undone) changes the replay set and forces a replay of the card."
  ],
